---
layout: layouts/product.njk
title: "Carrier Lookup"
description: "LRN, MNP, and carrier-of-record lookup services for routing decisions, fraud controls, and rate-deck classification."
---
{%- from "partials/v2/macros.njk" import arrow %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
	"@context": "https://schema.org",
	"@type": "Service",
	"serviceType": "LRN and carrier-of-record lookup",
	"name": "VoiceTel Carrier Lookup",
	"provider": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "{{ site.brand }}", "url": "{{ site.url }}" },
	"areaServed": ["US", "CA"],
	"url": "{{ site.url }}/carrier-lookup/",
	"description": "LRN, mobile-portability, and carrier-of-record lookups for routing decisions, fraud controls, and rate-deck classification. REST API, batch CSV, and portal queries."
}
</script>

<section class="hero hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container hero__inner">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Carrier Lookup</p>
			<h1 id="hero-heading">Know where a number routes before you rate, route, or risk-score it.</h1>
			<p class="lede">Carrier Lookup returns routing intelligence such as LRN, mobile portability, and carrier-of-record context so telecom teams can make better call-routing, fraud, and cost decisions.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/pricing/#lookup-carrier">See pricing {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/docs/api/">Read API docs</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__visual">
			<div class="terminal-tabs" data-tabs>
				<div class="tab-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Carrier lookup endpoints">
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-lrn" aria-controls="panel-lrn" aria-selected="true">LRN</button>
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-tfresporg" aria-controls="panel-tfresporg" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Toll-free RespOrg</button>
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-portcheck" aria-controls="panel-portcheck" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Portability check</button>
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-lrn" aria-labelledby="tab-lrn">
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "bash" %}curl -X POST https://api.voicetel.com/v2.1/info/lrn/ \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "apikey": "YOUR_API_KEY",
    "cid": 2015551234,
    "dst": 2125551234
  }'{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "lrn.sh", pill: "POST /v2.1/info/lrn", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-tfresporg" aria-labelledby="tab-tfresporg" hidden>
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "bash" %}curl -X POST https://api.voicetel.com/v2.1/info/tfresporg/ \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "apikey": "YOUR_API_KEY",
    "tn": 8005551234
  }'{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "tfresporg.sh", pill: "POST /v2.1/info/tfresporg", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-portcheck" aria-labelledby="tab-portcheck" hidden>
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "bash" %}curl -X POST https://api.voicetel.com/v2/iNumbering/portInAvailability/ \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "apikey": "YOUR_API_KEY",
    "tnList": {
      "tnItem": [
        { "tn": 2015551234 },
        { "tn": 2015555678 }
      ]
    }
  }'{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "port-check.sh", pill: "POST /v2/iNumbering/portInAvailability", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="workflows" aria-labelledby="workflows-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Workflows</p>
				<h2 id="workflows-heading">Three workflows, one API.</h2>
				<p class="lede">LRN lookup at signup time, fraud-check time, or call-setup time over REST and webhooks. Portal lookup with shareable URLs and exportable history for ops teams, with no API key required for users with portal access. Batch CSV for lists.</p>
				<p class="row__links">Full reference: <a href="{{ apiSpecs['v2.2'].urlPath }}#operation/lrnLookup">VoiceTel API v2.2 &rsaquo; LRN lookup</a> &middot; <a href="{{ apiSpecs.info.urlPath }}#operation/tfresporg">Info API v2.1 &rsaquo; Toll-free RespOrg</a> &middot; <a href="{{ apiSpecs['v2.2'].urlPath }}#operation/portInAvailability">VoiceTel API v2.2 &rsaquo; Port-in availability</a>.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				{%- set rows = [
					{ title: "Real-time API", meta: "call setup · signup · fraud checks", state: "REST · webhook", neutral: true },
					{ title: "Portal lookup", meta: "shareable URLs · exportable history", state: "No API key", neutral: true },
					{ title: "Batch", meta: "lists before a campaign or migration", state: "CSV", neutral: true },
					{ title: "Returns", meta: "LRN · mobile portability · carrier of record", state: "Per number", neutral: true }
				] %}
				{% include "partials/v2/status-card.njk" %}
			</div>
		</div>

		<h3 class="subsection-heading">Lookup modes</h3>
		{%- set featureHeading = "h4" %}
		{%- set features = [
			{ icon: "gear", title: "Real-time API", body: "Query numbers during call setup, signup, fraud checks, or support workflows." },
			{ icon: "box-arrow-in-right", title: "Portal queries", body: "Give operations teams a simple manual lookup path for support and troubleshooting." },
			{ icon: "diagram-3", title: "Routing context", body: "Use carrier-of-record and portability signals as inputs, not as the only routing control." }
		] %}
		{% include "partials/v2/feature-grid.njk" %}

		<div class="cta-band">
			<div class="cta-band__text">
				<h3 class="cta-band__title">One real number is worth ten case studies.</h3>
				<p class="cta-band__body">Run one query through the API or paste one in the portal. See the routing intelligence on a number you already know the answer for, then trust it on the ones you don't.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cta-band__actions cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/signup/">Free trial {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/docs/api/">Read API docs</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
